{"type": "say", "text": "Thanks, Elena, for the fair and thorough process. I appreciate you giving me this final chance to respond. Yes, I'm willing to add a second November maintenance visit to match Tariq's two. So my final terms would be: Saturday June 22, flat $180 guaranteed payment, four trays max on the raised benches with all heavy items off the floor for the full duration including setup and teardown per Jon's guidance, and two November maintenance visits. That gives you the certainty of a guaranteed $180 regardless of how sales go — no downside risk at all — plus the same level of maintenance help Tariq is offering. The difference is that with my offer you know exactly what you're getting financially, whereas with Tariq's you'd need strong sales to exceed $180. I think that combination of certainty and matching maintenance contribution makes this a strong final package, and I'm happy to leave it in your hands."}
